  "description": "Lim Tae-San, the second-in-command of the Waryong Association, clings to life after a traffic accident and possesses the body of Prosecutor Kang Ba-Run, who lies in a coma. Upon awakening, Tae-San discovers suspicious circumstances surrounding his own death. Using his connections and combat skills from his past life, along with his present intellect and wealth, he sets out to uncover the hidden conspiracy behind his death….\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
